close_reason: "Fixed four CodeRabbit review findings on PR #55. (1) Made coverage-gate tests POSIX-safe: import path.delimiter and use it for every PATH join, and skip the six #!/bin/sh fixture tests on win32 via node:test skip option, matching the pm-starter fix. (2) Reattached the orphaned JSDoc 'Rejects an ignore entry that still carries runtime code' as a // comment on the runtime-code verification loop it actually describes. (3) Corrected three stale npx tsc references in test doc comments to tsc, and fixed the createFixture description. (4) Hardened runScriptEntry to compare canonical realpathSync paths so a symlinked invocation path cannot silently skip the gate. Thresholds stay 100/100/100, ignore stays []"
